# This repo is scoped on purpose: it tracks only the core pipeline code
# (spatia/analysis modules + run_pipeline.py) and its yaml configs
# (cell-typing definitions + per-step run parameters).
# Everything else in the working directory (notebooks, slides, data,
# QuPath/Groovy scripts, Cirro manifest, docs, etc.) is intentionally
# untracked here — it still exists on disk, just not in git.
#
# Full project history is preserved locally on the
# 'backup/full-project-2026-07-28' branch.

*

!.gitignore

!spatia/
!spatia/__init__.py
!spatia/analysis/
!spatia/analysis/*.py
!spatia/*.yaml

!run_pipeline.py

# Dataset-agnostic prep script for survival.py's image_patient_map (TMA cohorts)
!build_image_patient_map.py

!cell_type_definitions/
!cell_type_definitions/*.yaml

!experiments/
!experiments/*.yaml

# Docs for the core pipeline steps only (not ui/, run_agentic.py's agentic
# layer, or validation.py — those aren't tracked in this whitelist repo).
!docs/
!docs/README.md
!docs/spatia_analysis_tif_conversion.md
!docs/spatia_analysis_roi_masking.md
!docs/spatia_analysis_segmentation.md
!docs/spatia_analysis_preprocessing.md
!docs/spatia_analysis_cell_typing.md
!docs/spatia_analysis_triads.md
!docs/spatia_analysis_functional.md
!docs/spatia_analysis_survival.md
!docs/build_image_patient_map.md
